---
id: {{ card.id }}
type: knowledge-card
title: {{ card.title }}
{%- if card.aliases %}
aliases: [{{ card.aliases | join(', ') }}]
{%- endif %}
version: {{ card.version }}
schema_version: {{ card.schema_version }}

domain: {{ card.domain }}
domain_name: {{ card.domain_name }}
subcategory: {{ card.primary_path[1] }}
{%- if card.secondary_domains %}
secondary_domains: [{{ card.secondary_domains | join(', ') }}]
{%- endif %}

knowledge_type: {{ card.facets.knowledge_type }}
epistemic_status: {{ card.facets.epistemic_status }}
risk_tier: {{ card.facets.risk_tier }}
skill_level: {{ card.facets.skill_level }}
audience: [{{ card.facets.audience | join(', ') }}]
service_lifecycle: [{{ card.facets.service_lifecycle | join(', ') }}]
context_sensitivity: [{{ card.facets.context_sensitivity | join(', ') }}]
actionability: {{ card.facets.actionability }}

confidence: {{ card.confidence.score }}
confidence_band: {{ card.confidence.band }}
claim_count: {{ card.evidence.claim_count }}
supporting_claims: {{ card.evidence.supporting_claims }}
contradicting_claims: {{ card.evidence.contradicting_claims }}
independent_groups: {{ card.evidence.independent_source_groups }}
distinct_creators: {{ card.evidence.distinct_creators }}
highest_evidence_tier: {{ card.evidence.highest_evidence_tier }}

has_parameters: {{ card.parameters | length > 0 }}
has_contradictions: {{ card.contradictions | length > 0 }}
lashos_usable: {{ card.lashos.usable }}
{%- if card.lashos.ai_features %}
ai_features: [{{ card.lashos.ai_features | map(attribute='feature') | join(', ') }}]
{%- endif %}

status: {{ card.status }}
created: {{ card.created_at | date }}
updated: {{ card.updated_at | date }}
last_evidence: {{ card.last_evidence_at }}
tags: [{{ card.render_tags | join(', ') }}]
---

> [!abstract] Definition
> {{ card.definition }}

**Confidence** {{ card.confidence.score }} ({{ card.confidence.band }})
· **Evidence** {{ card.evidence.claim_count }} claims / {{ card.evidence.independent_source_groups }} independent groups
· **Status** {{ card.facets.epistemic_status | replace('_', ' ') }}
· **Risk** tier {{ card.facets.risk_tier }}
{%- if card.facets.risk_tier >= 3 %}

> [!danger] Medical-adjacent knowledge
> This card is risk tier {{ card.facets.risk_tier }}. It must not be used for diagnosis.
> Reviewed by {{ card.review.reviewed_by }} on {{ card.review.reviewed_at | date }}.
{%- endif %}

## Summary
{{ card.summary }}

{% if card.mechanism %}## Why It Works
{{ card.mechanism }}
{% endif %}

{% if card.parameters %}## Parameters
| Parameter | Value | Unit | Applies to | Conditions | Conf |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{%- for p in card.parameters %}
| {{ p.name | humanize }} | {{ p | render_value }} | {{ p.unit or '—' }} | {{ p.applies_to | entity_link or '—' }} | {{ p.condition or '—' }} | {{ p.confidence }} |
{%- endfor %}
{%- for p in card.parameters if p.variance_note %}

> [!note] {{ p.name | humanize }}: {{ p.variance_note }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.practical_application %}## Practical Application
{{ card.practical_application }}
{% endif %}

{% if card.implementation_steps %}## Implementation
{%- for s in card.implementation_steps %}
{{ s.step }}. **{{ s.action }}**{% if s.detail %} {{ s.detail }}{% endif %} ^step{{ s.step }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.preconditions %}**Requires:** {{ card.preconditions | join(' · ') }}
{% endif %}

{% if card.common_mistakes %}## Common Mistakes
{%- for m in card.common_mistakes %}

> [!warning] {{ m.mistake }}
{%- if m.why_it_happens %}
> **Why it happens:** {{ m.why_it_happens }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if m.consequence %}
> **Consequence:** {{ m.consequence }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if m.correction %}
> **Correction:** {{ m.correction }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.exceptions or card.edge_cases %}## Exceptions & Edge Cases
{%- for e in card.exceptions %}
- **{{ e.condition }}** — {{ e.behaviour }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- for e in card.edge_cases %}
- {{ e }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.counter_indications %}## Do Not Apply When
{%- for c in card.counter_indications %}
> [!danger] {{ c.situation }}
> {{ c.reason }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.contradictions %}## Contradicting Viewpoints
{%- for c in card.contradictions %}

> [!question] {{ c.statement }}
> **Status** {{ c.resolution_status | replace('_', ' ') }}
{%- if c.resolution_note %}
> **Note** {{ c.resolution_note }}
{%- endif %}
> See [[{{ c.id | contradiction_link }}]]
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Evidence
| Tier | Count |
|---|---|
{%- for e in card.evidence.evidence_ledger %}
| {{ e.tier | humanize }} | {{ e.count }} |
{%- endfor %}

{% if card.key_quotes %}### Key Quotes
{%- for q in card.key_quotes %}

> {{ q.quote }}
> — [[{{ q.source_note }}|{{ q.creator_name }}]], {{ q.attribution }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if card.graph_mermaid %}## Knowledge Graph
```mermaid
{{ card.graph_mermaid }}
```
{% endif %}
{%- for group, rels in card.relations_by_group.items() %}
**{{ group | humanize }}:** {{ rels | map(attribute='link') | join(' · ') }}
{%- endfor %}

{% if card.lashos.usable %}## LashOS Applications
> [!tip] Product integration
{%- for f in card.lashos.ai_features %}
> - **{{ f.feature | humanize }}** — {{ f.use }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- for m in card.lashos.course_modules %}
> - **Course module** — *{{ m.module }}* ({{ m.level }}, {{ m.role | replace('_',' ') }})
{%- endfor %}
{%- for r in card.lashos.retention_intelligence %}
> - **Retention model** — {{ r }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Sources
| Creator | Platform | Date | Timestamp | Stance | Reliability |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{%- for s in card.sources %}
| [[{{ s.creator_name }}]] | {{ s.platform }} | {{ s.published_at }} | [{{ s.timestamp_label }}]({{ s.deep_link }}) | {{ s.stance }} | {{ s.reliability_score }} |
{%- endfor %}

<!-- LKE:HUMAN-OVERRIDE:START -->
{{ card.human_override_md or '' }}
<!-- LKE:HUMAN-OVERRIDE:END -->

